msgctxt "75\t271"
msgid ""
"What's the real purpose of\\n"
"your military expansion bill?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "273\t385"
msgid "My goal in all this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "389\t618"
msgid ""
"Is bringing a highly secretive global syndicate\\n"
"to light. And destroying them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628\t708"
msgid "What, like some mafia involved in the resort?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "723\t790"
msgid "If only it were that simple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792\t968"
msgid ""
"The organization I'm attempting to expose\\n"
"is known only as Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "973\t1024"
msgid "Black Monday?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1026\t1167"
msgid "Wait. You mean the black market arms dealers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1169\t1292"
msgid ""
"I see you're a reporter worth your salt.\\n"
"That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1294\t1545"
msgid ""
"The year was 1987. With the crash of the New York stock\\n"
"exchange, the world was thrust into economic depression."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1555\t1800"
msgid ""
"A man named Andre Richardson and his followers\\n"
"were thought to have orchestrated the whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1810\t1912"
msgid ""
"Both the day and his group\\n"
"were given the name Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1914\t2103"
msgid ""
"I concocted this Okinawa military scheme\\n"
"as a means of smoking them out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2115\t2263"
msgid ""
"Smoking them out?\\n"
"What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2288\t2528"
msgid ""
"As you know, this base has been touted as the\\n"
"linchpin of the revolutionary BMD system."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2530\t2674"
msgid "Trillions have been spent on its development."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2676\t2791"
msgid "Imagine how much the plans alone would be worth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2800\t2870"
msgid "It's no chump change, that's for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2888\t3062"
msgid ""
"With the combined effort of our superior\\n"
"technology and America's advanced weaponry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3064\t3195"
msgid ""
"This new BMD system,\\n"
"once installed at the Okinawa base..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3197\t3413"
msgid ""
"Would make us nigh untouchable by hostile nations.\\n"
"Japan would be the safest country known to man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3422\t3698"
msgid ""
"Any possible threat from the rest of Asia would be\\n"
"essentially nonexistent for decades to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3705\t3782"
msgid "They're putting something like that in Okinawa?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3805\t4007"
msgid ""
"This BMD system could bring about\\n"
"a massive shift in the global balance of power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4028\t4160"
msgid "At least, that's what everyone has been led to believe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4166\t4228"
msgid "Led to believe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4244\t4410"
msgid ""
"That's correct. It was absolutely vital\\n"
"that we propagated those rumors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4419\t4472"
msgid "What are you getting at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4490\t4700"
msgid ""
"Consider this highly advanced weapons technology.\\n"
"Who might be interested in making off with it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4708\t4838"
msgid "Hold on. You're not talking about... Black Monday!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4848\t4903"
msgid "Indeed I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4907\t5116"
msgid ""
"With clientele based all over the world,\\n"
"they're always on the lookout for new wares."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5123\t5229"
msgid ""
"And with these rumors circulating\\n"
"around the international market..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5232\t5475"
msgid ""
"Well, the end result isn't too difficult to imagine.\\n"
"This isn't an opportunity they can pass up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5490\t5640"
msgid ""
"So all this BMD stuff was just bait\\n"
"to draw Black Monday out into the light?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5655\t5937"
msgid ""
"Same goes for the military expansion bill.\\n"
"It was just a fake to trick them into resurfacing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5948\t6111"
msgid ""
"Fake or not, I had to act as though\\n"
"I was insistent on passing it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6116\t6334"
msgid ""
"That's why I suggested the resort to Suzuki.\\n"
"By pairing our two proposals..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6337\t6454"
msgid "I could keep both my bill and my scheme alive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6464\t6618"
msgid ""
"In other words, this tactic led me to\\n"
"deceive every last citizen in our country."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6623\t6735"
msgid "It was the only possible way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6745\t6930"
msgid ""
"But... you said you don't care\\n"
"about the bill passing anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6933\t6994"
msgid "Does that mean...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7004\t7040"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7044\t7208"
msgid ""
"After all this time,\\n"
"I've finally ensnared Black Monday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7330\t7502"
msgid ""
"Then, you never planned on running\\n"
"against Suzuki to be prime minister, either?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7519\t7700"
msgid ""
"Such a thing is for the young and vain.\\n"
"I have no interest in the position."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7794\t7988"
msgid ""
"But if even America's wrapped up in this...\\n"
"it's too big for you to have planned alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7998\t8050"
msgid "Right you are."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8065\t8145"
msgid "I'd like to speak further to that point as well."
msgstr ""